Quakeworld '''GetQuad! Kenya Invitational''' is a league featuring an alternative map pool to regular 4on4 tournaments. Players are drafted into teams. The ''"Kenya"'' refer to a more unusual and wider map pool than we're used to see.

===Format===
* '''Group stage:'''
** 5 teams in each group
** All matches are {{abbr|Bo3|Best of Three}}
** Groupstage will start March 15 and end April 18
* '''Playoffs:'''
** The top 4 teams in each group reach playoffs
** All matches are {{abbr|Bo5|Best of Five}}
** Playoffs will start April 19 and last 14 days

